WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.610
Class 3-B?

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.760
Ms. Kuroi!

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.920
Yeah, yeah...

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.630
Konata.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.250
Can I use your computer?

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.710
I want to type up something...

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:39.420
...for the meeting next week.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.170
Sure.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.840
Let's see...

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.930
I've been having difficulties lately...

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.930
...but I should have it finished in time...

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.770
...so I intend to speed things up...

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.650
...but without rushing...

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.530
...while keeping the committee mood in mind...

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.740
...and managing to work out all the details.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.120
Hey.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.750
Can we talk about your PC for a sec?

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:14.670
It's hard to use other people's computers, Kagami.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.050
I didn't check my inbox for two or three days...

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.930
...and now it's megas full!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.600
You don't look like someone who'd get a lot of mail.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.600
Cousin Yui...

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:30.680
Doesn't even bat an eye...

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:31.980
Of course I get mail.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.520
Maybe it's 'cause I visit all the right sites...

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.570
...but over 90% of these are junk or spam.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.070
It's hard for me to respond...

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:42.240
...so don't admit those things to a cop, okay?

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.660
Still, I've been thinking...

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:50.040
It's impressive how they can come up with all these interesting titles.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.580
That's true.

00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:00.590
It's going pretty fast.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.720
Maybe it'll finish sooner than expected.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.720
<i>It happens every time...</i>

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.310
<i>The way it goes up and down makes it useless!</i>

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.810
Guess I'll have a cup of ramen for a snack.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.480
Played me like a fool...

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:22.820
Hello.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.070
Welcome.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.700
I heard Konata and Yutaka are sick?

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:27.950
Whew...

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.450
You okay, Yutaka?

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.830
This hasn't happened in a while.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.000
Yo, Konata!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.790
You ok—

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:35.920
Cousin Yui.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.290
Welcome!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.920
You don't have the strength to go to class...

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.170
...but you have enough to play games.

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:43.670
Well...

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.550
You know...

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.340
You should understand, Cousin Yui.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.300
Hello!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.140
Minami and friends.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.810
You came to visit.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.020
Thanks!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.890
She's stuck in bed...

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:58.520
...but this is the first time she's had so much energy.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.730
I really appreciate it, Minami-chan.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:01.400
No.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.530
I didn't do anything...

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:06.240
She had some close friends back in middle school...

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.530
Maybe you two just have good chemistry.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.080
She's always talking about you.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.830
She must be having so much fun at school.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.080
You know how they say that sickness comes from the mind.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.340
And it looks like people forget they're sick when they're having fun.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.340
Hello!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.170
Minami and friends.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.800
You came to visit.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.010
Thanks!

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.800
She's stuck in bed...

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.470
...but this is the first time she's had so much energy.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.640
I really appreciate it, Minami-chan.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.390
No.

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:37.560
I didn't do anything...

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:41.230
She had some close friends back in middle school...

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.480
Maybe you two just have good chemistry.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.070
She's always talking about you.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.780
She must be having so much fun at school.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.780
Minami-chan, Tamura-san, and Patty-chan.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:54.490
Welcome.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.000
Are you okay?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.710
Get well soon!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:04:59.710
But...

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.670
I wonder why I'm so weak...

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.880
I don't like how I make other people worry.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.380
Nah.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:10.340
That ends up making people want to protect you.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.720
Well, it may sound good in theory...

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.350
...but it's usually hard on the person.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:17.390
You could say that...

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:19.060
...it's like how people who actually have little sisters...

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:22.020
...don't feel the charm of little sisters.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.810
That's it!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.020
Here it comes!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.360
The normal folks are shunning us!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.610
So this is the "no idea what you're talking about" aura!

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.240
It can't be helped!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.240
We're outlaws!

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.660
Speaking of weaknesses...

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.580
...you're sensitive about how you have no breasts, Minami-chan?

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:39.960
Really?

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.210
U-Um, well...

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.920
They say that they get bigger if you massage them, right?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.800
I've heard about that.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.710
I-Is it really okay...

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:49.630
...Minami-chan?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.590
You're the only one...

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:54.760
...I can ask to do this...

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.220
I-I'm going to touch you...

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:01.770
<i>Control yourself...</i>

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.270
<i>Control yourself, girl!</i>

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.860
So you're a member of that circle.

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:07.440
Yes.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.030
I participated in the last Summer Comiket.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.900
I have a few of your books.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:12.490
Man...

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:13.280
That's very kind of you.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.910
Really.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.950
I want to see the manga you draw, Tamura-san.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.790
Let me read some, Big Sister.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:20.910
Sure thi—

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.000
I-I don't think that's...

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.670
Nah, Hiyorin.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:28.420
Doujin works are meant to be seen.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.130
Please have mercy!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.720
Not to the normal people!

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:33.050
That's bad manners, Hiyorin.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.010
Anyone but them!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.970
That's incredible.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.720
Then let's go over the answers.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.890
Xylitol gum...

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.310
Yes.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.400
Has the ability to reduce cavities.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.100
That's because...

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:47.940
When Xylitol...

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.240
...is absorbed by bacteria...

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.280
...the bacteria's...

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.820
...ATP...

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.950
...is depleted and at the same time...

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:56.910
...the bacteria in the cavity...

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:58.490
...is broken down.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.950
<i>If they're so good for your teeth...</i>

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.460
<i>...I'll give it a try.</i>

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.770
I was chewing gum to help my teeth...

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.690
...and a filling fell out.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.150
Now I have to visit the dentist...

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.320
<i>The industrious yet slightly unlucky Miyuki-san turns me on.</i>

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.480
There, there.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:30.860
<i>The industrious yet slightly unlucky Miyuki-san turns me on.</i>

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:32.110
And so...

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.200
...Miyuki-san was crying today.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:35.450
Turned me on.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.860
R-Really...

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.330
That's what Big Sister said.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.080
So that's why Miyuki-san looked so down.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.710
I feel bad for this Miyuki-san...

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.710
...but I'm going to use that material!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.210
Well...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.460
I haven't been able to come up with ideas...

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:54.220
How do you come up with ideas for manga?

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.010
There really isn't a single method to it...

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:00.050
...but I use a lot of stuff from personal experience.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.560
P-Personal experience...?

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.520
You read them, didn't you?!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.890
Um, well...

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:05.980
You read them, didn't you?!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:06.390
Well...

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:09.310
After I begged her not to show you...

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.520
S-Sorry...

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.900
Those aren't based on personal experience...

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.780
B-But there were a lot of good stories...

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:16.950
...that I really enjoyed.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:17.950
Thanks...

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.120
I think it's called déjà vu.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:23.370
I felt like I'd experienced some parts.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.410
I would also like to read them.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.500
<i>Sorry!</i>

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.710
<i>So sorry...</i>

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.460
<i>That was probably the one based on you two...</i>

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:34.920
Teacher, good morning.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.130
What's wrong, Izumi?

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:37.470
Up all night playing games again?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.970
Or watching late-night anime?

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:39.470
Man...

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:43.310
They sure air a lot more late-night anime these days.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.100
Great time to be alive...

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.980
Can't you just lie and say you were studying?

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.060
Really...

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:52.020
I was considering splurging on a DVD recorder or something.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:53.980
Nah.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:54.690
Don't do it.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.110
You'll never get around to watching it.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.820
Like how games pile up, huh?

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.820
What are you talking about?!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.280
Hey!

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:04.990
Cut that out!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:07.000
That's not funny!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.870
Just so you know...

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.660
...it's none of my business what happens!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.760
Hello?

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.740
You didn't hang up just now, did you?

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.050
Well...

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:25.690
I had three bars, but I still got cut off...

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.770
Well, I guess I was a little immature there.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:30.560
Sorry.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.560
It's not like I hung up on you.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:37.070
<i>I've returned to this place again...</i>

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.190
Okay...

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.950
Let's see which one fell out.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.580
We can just stick it back in.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.540
It'll be over soon.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.750
But you've got another cavity developing in the back...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.000
...so let's start treating that.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.430
What's wrong?

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.470
I just realized that...

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:07.680
...strawberries smell like shortcake!

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:12.390
Er, don't you mean shortcake smells like strawberries?

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:14.060
Since it has strawberries inside.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.360
H-H-Huh?

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:16.940
Well...

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:20.070
People mix stuff up like that every now and then.

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:21.860
Uncle.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:22.700
Big Sister.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.110
Good morning!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.530
Yu-chan, good morning!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.120
Today's Bow-Wow.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.410
So many animals!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.580
They're doing a special on pets.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.210
First, we have...

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.880
...a Welsh corgi, Ku-chan.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:36.710
It's a corgi!

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:37.800
So cute!

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.260
The owner's not too bad either.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.380
She scores high for the thigh-highs.

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.760
And she has a nicely balanced absolute territory.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.350
She'd look good in a gothic maid outfit.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:51.140
Next, we have the Siberian husky, Silviana-chan.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.810
It's a husky!

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:55.730
You don't see many of them these days.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.190
I really like them.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.230
This girl's gotta be a tsundere!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.190
I'd hit it.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:04.490
Every girl with pigtails looks like a tsundere.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.080
So you also play games, Kusakabe.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.160
I like them, but I suck.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.410
Wanna play a bit?

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.880
You're good, Hiiragi.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:16.960
Wow!

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:22.170
Whoa, what was that?

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.260
Look!

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:24.550
Isn't Hiiragi amazing?

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:25.760
She really is.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:26.890
Is this for real?!

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:27.680
<i>When I see how much fun she's having...</i>

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:28.760
Out of my league!

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:32.430
<i>...I feel like a loser for caring so much about winning.</i>

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.020
Total classic, right?

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.480
You go for the stink, huh?

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:36.980
Patricia-san.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:38.110
Hello.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.320
You've been visiting a lot recently.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:44.070
Patty's a studious foreign student.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:49.120
Which is why I've been teaching her about the soul of Japanese culture every day.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.870
The stuff you teach her...

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:53.500
...is only a tiny fraction of Japanese culture.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.250
Geeks are the pride of Japanese culture!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.250
My critical mission is...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.090
...to absorb as much as I can...

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:00.670
That's right!
...and take it back to America!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.710
...and take it back to America!

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.510
I admire your passion...

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.510
Say, Patricia-san...

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:08.800
What kind of music do you listen to?

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.970
Let's see...

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.180
Orange Ran**.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.100
Chemis***.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.100
Suneoha**.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.390
Porno Graffi**.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.730
L'Arc~en~Ci**.

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:17.230
*inn.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:17.940
Night****.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:18.810
And many others.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.480
I'm listening to many different Japanese artists!

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.030
That's a surprise.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.030
But you know...

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.860
They all did anime songs, right?

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:27.280
Man.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.410
You're so sharp, Konata.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.740
And you only listen to their anime songs, right?

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.750
I'd like a maid.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.630
A maid.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.500
A maid, huh?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.880
You live by yourself instead of in a dorm?

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:45.340
Yes.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.680
I'm so busy with cooking, cleaning, manga, and anime!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.010
I guess it'd be hard if you're not used to it...

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:53.010
You'd want to hire a housekeeper.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:53.930
No, no.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:55.390
Not a housekeeper.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:56.650
A maid.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.730
Aren't they the same thing?

00:12:58.730 --> 00:12:59.310
Geez!

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.940
They're totally different!

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.820
What do they teach you in this country?!

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:04.610
Um...

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:06.690
Isn't your impression of Japan a little off?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.370
I-I can't let you have this.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:16.500
It's fried.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:21.710
He won't give up because he knows you're soft.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.090
It's hopeless.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.090
Come here, I'll give you this.

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:31.930
Eat slowly now.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:36.100
<i>But now I feel a little lonely.</i>

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:40.020
The class thinks that she's quiet and scary...

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:43.650
...but she's really kind, calm, and cool!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:48.780
She's really admired by Kobayakawa-san, a relative of Izumi-san.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:49.360
My...

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.320
Is that so?

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.530
Minami-chan!

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.660
Circular notice!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.830
Minami-chan is calm and cool, huh?

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:00.460
Which reminds me...

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.710
Izumi-san also said...

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:04.750
She looks all cool and flawless...

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:09.340
...but when you see her with
Yu-chan, you can tell she's a good person.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:10.840
That's what she said.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.430
I'm sorry.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.640
This is on sale...

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.850
...so it's limited to one per customer.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:19.850
My...

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.600
Minami-chan is cool and flawless.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.730
Also...

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:27.860
Kagami-san and Tsukasa-san...

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:32.110
Minami-chan looks like she can do everything quickly to perfection.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.360
Minami-chan looks like...

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:35.620
...she could do anything.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.910
I admire how she's so cool!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.120
Minami-san...

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.500
...is also admired by...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.790
...Kagami-san and Tsukasa-san.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:45.500
Mom?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.210
The item you wanted is limited to one per customer.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:15:11.490
Oh?

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.820
Minami-chan does everything quickly to perfection...

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:16.740
Yo!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:17.370
Ho!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.330
Welcome!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.620
What'cha watching?

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:22.000
A mecha anime I rented.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.000
Sure looks cool.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.460
You still like this stuff, huh?

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:30.340
I'm not really interested in mecha.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.880
You're not interested in mecha?

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.550
So why are you watching?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.640
In order to grab a wider audience...

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.180
...recent mecha anime almost always...

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:41.810
...features a cute boy or girl.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:44.020
Can you really call that a mecha anime?

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:44.730
Okay?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:45.520
Hiiragi?

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.480
Got it?

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.480
It's a promise!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.900
I'm counting on you tomorrow!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:50.690
Yeah, yeah.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:51.900
I'll take care of it.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:53.360
Come on, Misa-chan.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.740
Hiiragi-chan said okay.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.530
You shouldn't keep bothering her.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.700
But based on past experience...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:07.210
People who say they'll take care of it never intend to.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:07.790
<i>Bah.</i>

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.880
<i>She's sharp about the oddest things...</i>

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.550
Kagami the Great!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.880
Let's stop by Gamers on the way home!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.470
I don't need to buy anything...

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:17.010
..and I have something to do, so I'll pass.

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.140
C'mon...

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.220
Just for a bit...

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.140
No!

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:22.850
C'mon...

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.060
Don't play with my hair.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:24.680
Besides...

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:27.980
You have bookstores in your town, don't you?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.400
You know how once you've gone to a specialty store...

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.860
...a normal bookstore feels lacking in some way?

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.990
They might not have everything you want.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:40.240
That's 'cause the stuff you want is too unique.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:40.910
So?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:41.950
What are you getting?

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.330
I'm getting this today!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.450
You sure watch a lot of stuff...

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.660
I haven't watched the anime.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.710
But the second I saw this cover...

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.840
...I felt a connection somehow.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.380
It's been on my mind for a while.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:56.470
I don't get it.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:57.260
But you know...

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:01.390
I finally understand the concept of buying albums for their cover.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:02.050
You know?

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.430
You choose light novels based on their cover, right?

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.350
Well, I can't deny it...

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.770
When it turns out to be good...

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.230
...you feel like you got a great deal.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:11.360
And if it's not good...

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.650
...you don't regret it since you just bought it on a whim.

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:15.780
In other words...

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:17.530
...a once-in-a-lifetime encounter!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.990
You might think that you're making sense there...

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.030
...but that's a stretch.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.740
Let's take it easy.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.950
<i>Is this another once-in-a-lifetime encounter?</i>

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.460
That was grandiose.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.540
Cover your face.

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:32.290
Well...

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.880
You can't really control when you sneeze.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:39.170
This is the first time I've heard
someone actually go achoo when they sneeze.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.010
For some reason...

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.510
There's a world of difference between us after one sneeze...

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.050
No fair!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.180
It's no fair how cute your sneeze is!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:48.100
Don't tease her.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.980
After a round, it actually smells good now.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.850
But it's already over.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:54.440
You two sure are close.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.780
Do you guys ever fight?

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:57.650
Sure have!

00:17:57.650 --> 00:17:58.610
Believe it or not...

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:00.820
...Ayano's really scary when she's mad.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:03.370
It's true that some people are like that!

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:03.910
Geez...

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.410
Even Hiiragi-chan says so...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.240
By the way...

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.700
You're always scary, Hiiragi.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.370
So that's...

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.210
...my position in life?

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:17.000
Minami-chan runs the same time as you in the 100-meter dash.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.800
Really...

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.510
But...

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.010
I bet if we actually raced...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.970
...I'd win by the difference in our chests!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:23.900
As if!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:28.810
W-Wouldn't Minami-chan win because of her height?

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:31.270
Flat chest...

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.520
W-Wouldn't Minami-chan win because of her height?

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:34.440
Everyone just ignored that, huh?

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.130
Don't you agree, Hiiragi?

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:41.180
Isn't it fun, Hiiragi?

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.040
What do you think, Hiiragi?

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.240
<i>Misa-chan's "don't respond to everything with a mmm..."</i>

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:53.540
<i>...and Hiiragi-chan's "don't talk to me when I'm reading..."</i>

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.040
<i>...are really electrifying the air.</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:55.920
Man...

00:18:55.920 --> 00:19:00.090
The characters in Japanese anime and games really turn me on.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.470
Yep.

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:02.630
Huh?

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.680
Isn't this image bugged?

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.010
That's okay.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.550
This is how it's supposed to look.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.470
But it's still pretty naughty...

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:15.400
What kind of game are you playing there, high schoolers?

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.650
What are you all doing?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:19.610
Yu-chan doesn't need to know!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.410
It's done.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.490
I haven't written a long blog entry in a while.

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:29.830
And submit...

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.700
B-Back!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.210
Back!

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:49.760
Hey there!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:54.270
I'm not gonna read you the riot act...

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.600
Depressed.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:20:00.150
It doesn't matter what's happened...

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:01.480
The two of you...

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:02.150
You know?

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:07.070
Worked together to build this corner up from nothing, right?

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.200
And look at this.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:12.120
Why destroy it all at the end?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:13.580
Disappointed.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:21.630
I've done some things to make people call me dark and gloomy...

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:26.430
...but I've never had to mediate a pathetic fight like this!

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.510
Understand?

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:31.300
If we don't resolve this immediately, boys and girls...

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.850
...it's gonna make me look bad, too.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:35.310
Yeah, Shiraishi?

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:38.060
I-I'm terribly sorry.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.060
Gotouther-sama.

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.190
What do you think, Akira?

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.200
I'm sorry, Goto—

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.600
I'm sorry, Gotouther-sama!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.540
In that case...

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.870
Why don't you just kiss and make up?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:58.790
Okay?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.170
One more episode.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:04.050
Why don't you find your original
conviction and finish Lucky Channel?

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:04.840
Well?

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:05.800
How does that sound?

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:06.550
Underst—

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.720
Louder!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.090
Understood!

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:09.550
Okay.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:10.640
That's that.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:13.050
I'll let you two handle the rest.

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:16.980
Do your best to survive in the anime industry.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.900
Then I'll go home first.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:27.150
I'll talk to the producer.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.320
Call me if anything else happens.

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.930
I could lend you some help, if you want.

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:23.490
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.090
Shut up already!

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:28.000
Hey, people!

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.180
Can't you do a proper job on the last one?!

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.680
Are you listening?

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:32.220
Hey!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:34.140
Forget it.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.640
I'll do it myself!

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:36.930
Next time:

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.060
TBA.

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:38.730
Wait, what?

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:39.980
They didn't name it yet?!
